   Do not edit by hand. Names are the first-seen optimiser column.
   Route suffixes stay on the route table. Uppercase keeps the name a string.
   A null out-pointer returns 4. An index outside 0..count-1 returns 2.
   No libc and no include. */
int pon_count(void) {
